## 11. FAQ (Gameplay‑Focused)

**Q: Can I get stuck on an animal board?**  
Yes, some layouts can become unsolvable if animals are placed poorly. Use the remove‑animal tool or restart the level if no matches remain.

**Q: How do I unlock new animals and maps?**  
Progress through levels, complete objectives, and reach milestones indicated on the globe map; new animals and habitats appear as you advance.

**Q: Is there any time limit?**  
Core puzzle boards are designed to be relaxing; most levels do not use hard timers, letting you plan moves at your own pace.

**Q: Can I play only one mode?**  
Yes, you can focus on your favorite mode (animal matching, barn sorting, or village building), but playing across modes usually grants the fastest progression and the most variety.

